   "label": "Registered 22 Oct 2007; in Belgium, France, Germany, Poland, the UK, Italy and Israel; describes itself as \"the most influential pro-Israel advocacy organisation in Europe\"; takes European lawmakers and officials to Israel."
  },
  {
   "f": "elnet",
   "t": "parliament",
   "type": "influence",
   "status": "reported",
