   "status": "verified",
   "src": "g_aj_veto",
   "label": "By 2023 the US had vetoed Israel-related Security Council resolutions 46 times, and cast 34 of the 36 vetoes on Israel-Palestine drafts since 1945 (Al Jazeera count)."
  },
  {
